  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Slice zucchini into half-moons.\n• Cut capsicum into bite-size chunks.\n• Roughly chop leek.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray, drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 15-20 minutes.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839594ef7d5496ac4a6f3fe/step-a3d27200.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.\n• Heat a large saucepan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Add cannellini beans, Aussie spice blend and half the garlic, then cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add passata, vegetable stock pot (see ingredients) and the water and simmer, stirring occasionally, until reduced, 5-6 minutes.\n• Remove from heat and stir through roasted veggies. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839594ef7d5496ac4a6f3fe/step-833b9110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While soup is cooking, slice bake-at-home ciabatta in half lengthways.\n• Place the plant-based butter and remaining garlic in a small bowl and microwave in 10 second bursts until softened. Season with salt.\n• Brush garlic butter over the cut sides of ciabatta.\n• Place on another lined oven tray and bake until golden, 5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839594ef7d5496ac4a6f3fe/step-40fc0320.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide cannellini bean, haloumi and veggie soup between bowls.\n• Serve with garlic ciabatta.\n• Top with plant-based basil pesto to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839594ef7d5496ac4a6f3fe/step-9f971830.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
